{
  "name": "Resonance Core",
  "icon": "cyberfarm:resonance_core",
  "category": "cyberfarm:energy_storage",
  "sortnum": 2,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "cyberfarm:resonance_core",
      "text": "The Resonance Core is CyberFarm's big battery, from 1,000,000 FE up to 2,000,000,000 FE. It is a pedestal with a crystal floating over it, and you build it bigger tier by tier.$(br2)It has three parts:"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(li)the $(l)Resonance Core$() itself: the pedestal, the battery and its screen;$(br)$(li)a shell of $(l:energy_storage/resonance_cell)Resonance Cells$(/l) around the crystal: a bigger shell is a higher tier;"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(li)columns of $(l:energy_storage/stabilizer_pylon)Stabilizer Pylons$(/l) on its sides: each sends out a drone that circles the crystal and holds it steady with waves. Power goes in and out $(l)only through the pylons$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(li)Place the $(l)Resonance Core$() (the pedestal). Alone it is tier 1.$(br)$(li)For tiers 2 to 4, build a shell of $(l:energy_storage/resonance_cell)Resonance Cells$(/l) in the space right above it.$(br)$(li)Put up the columns of $(l:energy_storage/stabilizer_pylon)Stabilizer Pylons$(/l) the tier asks for, on its sides.",
      "title": "Building it"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(li)Connect cables to the pylons to fill it and to draw from it (see $(l:energy_storage/stabilizer_pylon)Stabilizer Pylon$(/l)).$(br)The $(l:basics/multiblock_projector)Multiblock Projector$(/l) shows tiers 2 to 4, pylons included: sneak + right-click to pick the tier, then click the pedestal."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Every tier at its smallest, with the pylons at their closest. Drag to turn the scene.$(br2)$(l)Tier 1$()$(br2)The core alone: one pylon column, two blocks tall, at least three blocks away.",
      "title": "What each tier looks like"
    },
